'''Bazaar of the Pirate King''' (海賊王商店街, ''Kaizokuō Shōtengai'', '''Pirate King Shopping Street''') is the 46th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 95th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A fairly standard sub-chapter that combines [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies with a variety of threats. Nothing too out of the ordinary, though.
{{LegendDiff|120|140|100}}

==New Features==
This subchapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Great Angel Chibinel]]: A smaller, [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] with fairly high health and [[Long Distance]] attacks. He behaves similarly to [[Tackey]], but also has the ability to [[Slow|slow]] and [[Weaken|weaken]] Cats.

